# Harness CLI binaries staged for the worker image build (large, not in git).
# The Pi extension policy payload is a few KB and MUST be tracked: it carries
# the pin/lockfile, MIT license, audit record, ceiling config, agent
# definitions and the vendor patch (open-harness-v2-subagent-adaptation.md §6.4).
deploy/worker-cli/*
!deploy/worker-cli/pi-subagents/

